1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
‪SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,160 --> 00:01:38,920
‪ADAPTED FROM <i>‪JIA JIN CHAI</i>‪, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‪BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,640
She…

4
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,440
She's an impostor.

5
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:12,720
She's… Not the real one…

6
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,680
Why isn't the physician here yet?

7
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,000
Hurry!

8
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,600
Not the real…

9
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:45,520
Grandmother. You already knew the one at
the Duke's Residence wasn't the real one.

10
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:46,680
This old woman's words were hardly needed.

11
00:02:46,760 --> 00:02:48,680
She made a grave mistake
at the Wei Residence

12
00:02:48,760 --> 00:02:51,720
and hoped the Zhou family
would take her in.

13
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:54,040
To end up like this…

14
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:55,800
She only has herself to blame.

15
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:12,960
She is from the Earl
of Cheng'an's Residence, after all.

16
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:16,760
Send for the Wei family
and have them take her away.

17
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:33,200
Take her away.

18
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,200
If you wanted to question her,

19
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,560
you could've done it anywhere
at Xianzhuang.

20
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:47,920
Why take her all the way to the rear hill,

21
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,200
send the guards away,

22
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:50,240
and question her alone?

23
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:52,840
Unless this secret
has something to do with you.

24
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:55,160
Nothing you've done tonight makes sense.

25
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,520
- I shouldn't have indulged you.
- Yes!

26
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,480
I did it.

27
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,080
You know,

28
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:15,160
my father abandoned his wife
and daughter to serve his country.

29
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:19,000
My mother abandoned me for power and glory
at the palace.

30
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:22,160
Then there's my grandmother,
obsessed with family's honor.

31
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:26,320
They all got exactly what they wanted.

32
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:28,000
Every one of them is selfish!

33
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:31,480
Then why am I the one
expected to be selfless?

34
00:04:33,560 --> 00:04:34,440
Yes.

35
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:38,160
I'm spoiled and willful.
I'm cruel to servants.

36
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:39,840
I'm bad. I'm vicious.

37
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,520
I've done every awful thing imaginable!

38
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:44,760
But I'm scared.

39
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:49,760
I'm scared she'll tell
Maternal Grandmother everything I've done

40
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:51,000
and make you all hate me.

41
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,200
I won't let that happen. I won't!

42
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,880
- Rao, I…
- Don't you love me, Jue?

43
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:00,720
Every year, the Huo family caravans

44
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,640
bring treasures back
from the Western Regions.

45
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:05,400
You always pick the finest ones for me.

46
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,960
If you love someone, you put them first.

47
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:12,520
You have to stand by me no matter what.

48
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:15,640
Even if you're bad?

49
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,760
Even if you're vicious?

50
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,360
Even if I'm vicious.

51
00:05:25,080 --> 00:05:27,760
Even if I do terrible things,
you still have to help me.

52
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,640
Huo Jue.

53
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,800
I need you.

54
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:46,320
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

55
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:48,400
My Lady.

56
00:05:48,480 --> 00:05:50,800
Lady Li is watching your every move.

57
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:52,320
You're already in danger yourself.

58
00:05:52,400 --> 00:05:54,640
How can you worry about those refugees?

59
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:58,720
Why don't we have Liangcai quietly fetch
Madam Qiao and your sister,

60
00:05:58,800 --> 00:06:00,400
and hide them somewhere safe?

61
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:02,520
That would keep you out of danger.

62
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:08,160
Lady Li threatened me today
only to throw me off balance.

63
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:11,320
If I send someone to hide Mother now,

64
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:14,480
I'll only lead her straight to Mother.

65
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:18,040
She hasn't made a move

66
00:06:18,560 --> 00:06:20,960
only because she fears
the Empress Dowager and the Lu family.

67
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:27,280
Tell me,
why is everyone so afraid of Lady Li?

68
00:06:29,320 --> 00:06:31,800
Because she's
the Emperor's favorite consort.

69
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:36,600
She has the Emperor's power behind her,
giving her status and authority.

70
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:38,680
But now I have a title too.

71
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:42,400
- But your title is…
- An empty title.

72
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:46,120
It's prestigious in name only. Unless…

73
00:06:51,200 --> 00:06:52,400
Unless…

74
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,880
I become a true thane with real power,

75
00:06:58,320 --> 00:07:01,600
with the people's support
and authority in my hands,

76
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,280
with real power and prestige.

77
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:09,960
Then what could a palace consort
possibly do against me?

78
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,560
After all, the Empress Dowager
rules the palace,

79
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:17,280
the court has its officials,
and the people have a voice.

80
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:23,800
She can't rule over everyone yet.

81
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,880
The 500 mu refers to fertile farmland.

82
00:07:32,960 --> 00:07:35,320
Beyond the hills, there's still plenty
of uncultivated wasteland,

83
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:37,120
about another 500 mu.

84
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,440
The harvests have been poor lately.

85
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,960
Hutuo has kept raiding the border.

86
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,360
Refugees are coming nonstop
from the north.

87
00:07:45,560 --> 00:07:47,000
Why not clear more land?

88
00:07:47,840 --> 00:07:49,520
The Han family
has built homes all over this area

89
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:52,040
and raised vast estates,
taking on huge numbers of workers.

90
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:54,480
The refugees all become
their bonded servants,

91
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,160
working for free
and doing every kind of labor.

92
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,920
They don't even have freedom.

93
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:00,240
The wasteland they work so hard on.

94
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,920
Who does it all end up to?

95
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:05,480
The Han family
has controlled this area for years.

96
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:08,280
They have vast fertile lands
and immense power.

97
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:12,360
They have thousands of servants
and tens of thousands of dependents.

98
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,600
Will the crops grown on this land…

99
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:23,560
also become the Han family's wealth
to fund their private army?

100
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:27,480
Exactly. He'll never give up
his hold on this place.

101
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:32,919
He'll do everything he can
to drive you out for good.

102
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:36,320
- What are you doing?
- Back up!

103
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,679
- Get back!
- Back up!

104
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,640
- Now we can't even use the well?
- What are you doing?

105
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,880
- You're trying to kill us!
- Indeed.

106
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:43,640
- Exactly!
- That's right!

107
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,440
I said you can't use it, so you can't!

108
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:46,440
Not even a drop!

109
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:47,520
Smash them all!

110
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,360
- Stop!
- Don't do this!

111
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:52,480
What are you doing?

112
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,720
Do you have a death wish?

113
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,800
- Fang!
- Grandpa!

114
00:09:03,640 --> 00:09:05,000
No!

115
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:15,160
I'll kill you!

116
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:24,920
You've gone too far! Seize them!

117
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,080
Nobody move!

118
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:34,640
Your Ladyship, please save us!

119
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:37,320
None of us can survive like this!

120
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:41,120
Everyone, kneel! Beg Her Ladyship!

121
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:44,000
Kneel! Beg Her Ladyship!

122
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:47,200
Please save us!

123
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:52,240
Please, Your Ladyship!

124
00:09:55,840 --> 00:10:02,320
Your Ladyship, please save us!

125
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,160
Han Liao!

126
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,720
I'll make you and your lackeys

127
00:10:20,320 --> 00:10:22,800
run away with your tails
between your legs!

128
00:10:22,880 --> 00:10:24,560
And leave this land forever!

129
00:10:28,040 --> 00:10:30,480
Did you all hear what she just said?

130
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,440
Such bold words.

131
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:34,560
I'm absolutely terrified.

132
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:35,800
Barely made a Noble Lady,

133
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:38,440
and already you think
you're above everyone.

134
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:44,360
I'd love to see how Noble Lady Wu'an
plans to drive me out herself!

135
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,520
No!

136
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,440
Bullying the old and weak.

137
00:10:50,520 --> 00:10:52,200
How despicable!

138
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,600
Fetch the physician.
Help the wounded get treatment.

139
00:10:56,680 --> 00:10:57,600
Yes.

140
00:10:59,720 --> 00:11:01,880
My Lord, didn't you say

141
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:04,400
Lord Han had another beautiful estate
that he gave me as well?

142
00:11:04,480 --> 00:11:05,320
I'd like to see it.

143
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,320
It's just ahead. Let's go.

144
00:11:16,640 --> 00:11:19,560
Keep watch. If anyone makes a move,

145
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:20,960
tie up and send to the magistrate's.

146
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,920
Keep a close eye on them!

147
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:34,080
My Lord, should we…

148
00:11:34,760 --> 00:11:35,600
No rush.

149
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:39,280
I control the only irrigation canal.

150
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,000
What can she possibly do?

151
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:47,640
Sooner or later,
she'll come crawling back to beg me.

152
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,800
All along the way,

153
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,720
flowers bloom in the east,
while grapevines fill the west.

154
00:11:57,240 --> 00:12:00,760
From the Lingbi stones in the garden
to the golden-red fish in the pond,

155
00:12:00,840 --> 00:12:02,360
and the colorful parrots on their perches,

156
00:12:02,880 --> 00:12:05,120
every treasure here cost a fortune.

157
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,000
Opulent, yet tasteful.

158
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:09,920
Extravagant, yet full of charm.

159
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:12,200
No wonder Han Liao knows
how to please the Empress Dowager.

160
00:12:12,280 --> 00:12:14,200
He certainly knows
how to enjoy the finer things.

161
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,880
But this estate is yours now.

162
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,160
You rarely spent time
in the capital before.

163
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:20,360
Most people don't know you.

164
00:12:20,880 --> 00:12:23,840
Use your title as Noble Lady Wu'an
to invite the noble families

165
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:25,800
and build some useful connections.

166
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,240
That huge Lingbi stone we just saw

167
00:12:29,760 --> 00:12:32,080
was hauled over a thousand li
from the south to the capital.

168
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:35,040
Who knows how many died along the way?

169
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:38,800
You said you'd drive Han Liao
out for good.

170
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:40,480
That won't be easy.

171
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:42,480
The refugees and thugs who follow him

172
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:43,400
will keep coming.

173
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:45,800
The moment swords
are drawn and blood is spilled,

174
00:12:45,880 --> 00:12:47,560
the Han family will have
countless charges ready against you.

175
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,120
They've probably
already written the accusations.

176
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:52,720
They're just waiting for you
to walk into their trap.

177
00:12:53,240 --> 00:12:57,880
CAISHU HALL

178
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,080
I do need to host a gathering.

179
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:02,000
Now you're talking.

180
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:05,560
Have the Duchess of Ying host it
and invite the Eldest Princess.

181
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,440
Let's see if the Han family
still dares to cause trouble.

182
00:13:08,520 --> 00:13:09,360
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

183
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:12,760
Once the Eldest Princess arrives,
the refugees will vanish.

184
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:13,960
But once the royals leave,

185
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:18,680
they'll show up like moles
all across the fields again.

186
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:22,160
That's how ruthless Han Liao is.

187
00:13:23,120 --> 00:13:26,600
I won't invite the noble families.
Nor any imperial relatives.

188
00:13:29,760 --> 00:13:31,280
Then who will you invite?

189
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,320
The people.

190
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:34,120
No.

191
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:37,920
I'll invite the voices no one can silence.

192
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:43,160
My Lord, these past two days,

193
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:44,600
quite a few scholars
have come to the estate.

194
00:13:44,680 --> 00:13:48,320
I cut off her canal
and ruined the livelihood of the fields.

195
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:51,440
She should be taking those refugees
to petition His Majesty.

196
00:13:52,120 --> 00:13:53,920
Why is she hiding instead?

197
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:56,080
My Lord, since the indentures
and deeds are destroyed,

198
00:13:56,160 --> 00:13:57,920
why don't we just seize the estate?

199
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:00,720
Idiot. His Majesty gave his word.

200
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:04,080
We can't act so openly
and give them grounds against us.

201
00:14:07,120 --> 00:14:07,960
Go on.

202
00:14:08,040 --> 00:14:12,440
Why has Noble Lady Wu'an gathered
all those penniless scholars?

203
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:15,040
Everyone says Noble Lady Wu'an
is incredibly generous to guests.

204
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:17,360
She holds feasts every day
for anyone who comes.

205
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:19,560
Anyone can attend.
Her Ladyship charges nothing.

206
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:21,000
She has only one condition.

207
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,760
Before leaving, every guest
must leave behind a work of art.

208
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,800
Poetry or paintings, either will do,

209
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:25,800
but they must praise her beauty
and generosity

210
00:14:25,880 --> 00:14:27,520
and spread her fame throughout the realm.

211
00:14:27,600 --> 00:14:29,880
If the work is good,
she even pays them for it.

212
00:14:30,920 --> 00:14:33,400
I thought she'd risk everything
for those paupers.

213
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,920
Turns out she's just chasing fame,

214
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:38,480
feeding a bunch of freeloading parasites

215
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:42,560
so they'll sing her praises.

216
00:14:44,560 --> 00:14:45,760
Vain and shortsighted.

217
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,560
Can I go now?

218
00:14:47,640 --> 00:14:49,480
- If I'm late, I'll miss the feast.
- Get lost.

219
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,840
I gave her far too much credit.

220
00:15:16,920 --> 00:15:18,200
Is everything ready?

221
00:15:18,280 --> 00:15:20,760
Everything is ready
as your Ladyship ordered.

222
00:15:24,200 --> 00:15:25,080
Your Ladyship.

223
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:31,520
- Greetings, Your Ladyship.
- Greetings, Your Ladyship.

224
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:34,840
Everyone.

225
00:15:44,080 --> 00:15:45,320
Liu Ziyang.

226
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:48,000
You're usually arrogant
and think you're above everyone. Fine.

227
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:50,320
But Noble Lady Wu'an
invited you to her feast.

228
00:15:50,400 --> 00:15:53,800
You stuffed yourself,
yet couldn't even thank your host?

229
00:15:53,880 --> 00:15:55,600
What kind of manners are those?

230
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:57,120
- Exactly.
- That's right.

231
00:15:57,200 --> 00:15:59,800
- It's improper.
- That's hardly decent.

232
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:02,400
Your Ladyship is certainly beautiful,

233
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,400
but I see little talent or virtue.

234
00:16:04,920 --> 00:16:06,640
You earned a title
without a single achievement

235
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:08,680
and then bought yourself
a good name with petty favors.

236
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:12,600
Yet you fail to understand
that the finest swords come from Wuyue…

237
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:13,560
Liu Ziyang!

238
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:15,640
And the finest jade comes from Mount Jing.

239
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,360
A phoenix only chooses
a worthy place to land.

240
00:16:18,160 --> 00:16:20,800
The wise have always followed
those worthy of serving.

241
00:16:21,760 --> 00:16:24,240
Your Ladyship buys loyalty
with fine wine and meat.

242
00:16:25,280 --> 00:16:27,640
All you attract are useless freeloaders.

243
00:16:27,720 --> 00:16:28,760
- You…
- You!

244
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:30,480
- And those silly verses they wrote?
- What does he say?

245
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:32,480
- How arrogant.
- My advice to Your Ladyship

246
00:16:32,560 --> 00:16:34,000
is not to spread them around.

247
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,600
You'll only make yourself a laughingstock.

248
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:39,240
Liu Ziyang,
who are you calling freeloaders?

249
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,800
She invited you here out of kindness.

250
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:42,360
How dare you be so rude?

251
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:43,720
Ungrateful and shameless!

252
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:45,120
You're a disgrace to all scholars!

253
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:46,720
- Exactly!
- That's right!

254
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:48,600
- Shameless!
- Absolutely shameless!

255
00:16:48,680 --> 00:16:50,480
- Stop.
- Ashamed to be with him.

256
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,040
What?

257
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:56,840
Is Your Ladyship going to kill me?

258
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:07,160
I made it clear from the start.

259
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:10,720
Every scholar who attends my feast
receives a parting gift.

260
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:12,920
Please accept it, sir.

261
00:17:22,599 --> 00:17:24,040
How ugly.

262
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:28,160
- How can he say that?
- That's simply outrageous.

263
00:17:28,240 --> 00:17:29,800
- Good! nicely done!
- Serves him right!

264
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:32,960
Everyone here
came to speak up for the people.

265
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:35,400
We have no use for someone
who judges by looks

266
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,040
and is as arrogant as he is ignorant!

267
00:17:37,640 --> 00:17:38,920
- Throw him out.
- Yes.

268
00:17:47,040 --> 00:17:48,440
- Your Ladyship!
- Your Ladyship!

269
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:54,600
- Your Ladyship!
- Please give us justice! Your Ladyship!

270
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,560
CAISHU HALL

271
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:58,800
- Please give us justice, Your Ladyship!
- Please give us justice!

272
00:17:58,880 --> 00:18:02,840
Your Ladyship, please give us justice!

273
00:18:04,560 --> 00:18:05,840
Please give us justice!

274
00:18:05,920 --> 00:18:07,520
Please don't kneel.
If you've been wronged,

275
00:18:07,600 --> 00:18:08,560
just tell me what happened.

276
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:10,760
The Han family cut off our only canal.

277
00:18:10,840 --> 00:18:14,640
Our crops are about to die!

278
00:18:15,320 --> 00:18:18,440
They seized our fields
and took over the wells.

279
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:22,960
More than half our livestock
have died of thirst…

280
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:24,840
Look at these wounds.

281
00:18:24,920 --> 00:18:27,320
The Han family's men did this to us.

282
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:29,120
Please, have mercy.

283
00:18:29,200 --> 00:18:31,240
Please save us!

284
00:18:31,320 --> 00:18:35,840
Please save us, Your Ladyship!

285
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:40,840
- Please give us justice, Your Ladyship!
- What can we do?

286
00:18:42,760 --> 00:18:43,640
Your Ladyship.

287
00:18:44,440 --> 00:18:46,880
We're just poor scholars
from humble families.

288
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:49,240
We can barely feed and clothe ourselves.

289
00:18:49,920 --> 00:18:53,040
What power could we possibly have
to save all these people?

290
00:18:57,800 --> 00:19:03,080
You are all learned men,
the future pillars of this nation.

291
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:05,560
Your day to soar will surely come.

292
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,640
You won't be down on your luck forever.

293
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,760
I'd like to do what little I can

294
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:12,480
and provide simple meals
and lodging each day.

295
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:15,480
You're all welcome to stay
and focus on your studies.

296
00:19:17,440 --> 00:19:23,840
But the grain and vegetables here
are all grown by the local people.

297
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:29,480
If they're driven to ruin,
this estate won't survive either.

298
00:19:34,080 --> 00:19:37,200
So please put your talents to use
and speak from the heart.

299
00:19:37,920 --> 00:19:40,560
Write poems about the people's suffering.

300
00:19:42,280 --> 00:19:44,240
CAISHU HALL

301
00:19:56,400 --> 00:19:57,480
How could I, Liu Ziyang,

302
00:19:57,560 --> 00:20:01,840
miss a righteous cause like
fighting evil and helping the people?

303
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:03,800
We don't need you.

304
00:20:14,680 --> 00:20:17,280
I was blind and foolish.

305
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:19,760
You care for the people's
suffering and hardships.

306
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:20,960
You truly have a heart of gold.

307
00:20:21,560 --> 00:20:23,360
I sincerely beg your forgiveness.

308
00:20:24,000 --> 00:20:26,720
It's never too late to admit mistakes.

309
00:20:26,800 --> 00:20:27,960
You're defending him?

310
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:39,040
Your Ladyship's noble heart
has won my deepest respect.

311
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:41,320
But while we're here,

312
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:45,320
eating the grain these people grow
and drinking the wine they brew,

313
00:20:46,040 --> 00:20:47,840
how can we stay silent
just because we fear the powerful?

314
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:51,960
- If you won't, I will!
- Are you writing or not?

315
00:20:55,400 --> 00:20:56,280
You've misunderstood.

316
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,960
I'm not asking you
to risk petitioning the court,

317
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:00,760
or offend the powerful.

318
00:21:00,840 --> 00:21:03,360
Just write a few simple rhymes
or folk verses.

319
00:21:04,000 --> 00:21:09,000
Ideally, a catchy tune that even
the unlettered can sing along to.

320
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,280
Catchy tunes?

321
00:21:10,360 --> 00:21:11,360
So that's what she meant.

322
00:21:11,440 --> 00:21:12,440
That's easy to write.

323
00:21:13,120 --> 00:21:14,480
That's all?

324
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:20,120
Her Ladyship asked you to write,
so get to it.

325
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:22,240
Do it well, and Her Ladyship
will reward you handsomely.

326
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,400
Come on, let's go.

327
00:21:26,480 --> 00:21:28,080
- Let's get ink and brushes.
- I'll write.

328
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,360
Everyone, please get up!

329
00:21:35,960 --> 00:21:41,880
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!
- Thank you, Your Ladyship!

330
00:21:47,840 --> 00:21:48,680
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

331
00:21:48,760 --> 00:21:50,160
You've written this one?

332
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,840
- Nice one.
- Well written.

333
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:54,000
- How charming.
- Take a look at mine.

334
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:56,000
- You know where to spread these?
- Yes, I do.

335
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:57,240
That's real talent.

336
00:21:57,320 --> 00:21:59,080
- Leave it to me.
- What are you doing?

337
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,480
- Nice.
- Let's read yours.

338
00:22:01,560 --> 00:22:02,600
My Lord.

339
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:05,600
There are places you can't get into.

340
00:22:05,680 --> 00:22:06,840
I'll have to arrange those myself.

341
00:22:07,360 --> 00:22:08,280
Leave everything to Jiede.

342
00:22:09,240 --> 00:22:10,160
Yes.

343
00:22:10,880 --> 00:22:12,600
Rao is entertaining guests inside, right?
I'll go take a look.

344
00:22:12,680 --> 00:22:13,760
My Lord.

345
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,240
What is it?

346
00:22:17,200 --> 00:22:19,080
Your Ladyship invited scholars
from everywhere.

347
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:20,960
Why can't I go?

348
00:22:21,760 --> 00:22:23,040
Her Ladyship said

349
00:22:23,120 --> 00:22:26,320
the Han family resents
her most for taking this land.

350
00:22:26,400 --> 00:22:28,000
It had nothing to do with the Lu family.

351
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:29,520
As long as you stay out of it,

352
00:22:29,600 --> 00:22:32,480
this remains a private feud
between her and the Han family.

353
00:22:32,560 --> 00:22:34,720
If you keep getting involved
with the estate,

354
00:22:34,800 --> 00:22:37,000
the feud between the Lu and Han families
will only deepen.

355
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:39,680
Besides,
the hall is full of scholars today.

356
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:40,920
If you go inside,

357
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:45,120
people may accuse the Lu family
of recruiting followers

358
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:47,200
- for its own gain.
- It doesn't sound like a ballad at all.

359
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:54,240
Good one here. This one too.

360
00:22:54,920 --> 00:22:56,200
Mine will be remembered for the ages!

361
00:22:58,240 --> 00:22:59,760
She doesn't mind troubling Qi Zhongkai

362
00:23:00,440 --> 00:23:03,520
or dragging outsiders into this,
but she's afraid of troubling me.

363
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:07,080
How thoughtful of her.

364
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:08,360
What a considerate wife.

365
00:23:10,480 --> 00:23:11,320
Your Ladyship.

366
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:12,920
- Hurry!
- Let her see it.

367
00:23:13,000 --> 00:23:13,960
Yes, yes!

368
00:23:14,520 --> 00:23:15,640
- Your Ladyship.
- Your Ladyship.

369
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,560
- Please read this one.
- Mine too.

370
00:23:17,640 --> 00:23:18,640
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

371
00:23:18,720 --> 00:23:19,800
Show it to Her Ladyship.

372
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:21,840
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

373
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:24,560
<i>Look at the rat. It still has skin</i>

374
00:23:24,640 --> 00:23:27,080
<i>Yet a man has no shame</i>

375
00:23:27,680 --> 00:23:33,040
<i>If a man has no shame,</i>
<i>why does he still live?</i>

376
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:36,280
<i>Look at the rat. It still has teeth.</i>

377
00:23:36,360 --> 00:23:40,320
<i>- Yet a man knows no bounds.</i>
- What nonsense are you spouting? Go!

378
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:42,120
- Come hit me!
- Stop talking nonsense!

379
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,520
- Hit me!
- Come on, hit me!

380
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:44,440
- My Lord.
- Run!

381
00:23:44,520 --> 00:23:45,400
I'll bring them back at once.

382
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:48,440
The palace summons must be urgent.

383
00:23:48,520 --> 00:23:50,560
We can't delay.
We'll go to the palace first.

384
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,000
Yes.

385
00:23:53,640 --> 00:23:55,160
That corrupt official
treats lives like nothing!

386
00:23:55,240 --> 00:23:56,200
A butcher!

387
00:23:56,840 --> 00:23:59,880
These rich and powerful men
all treat human lives as worthless.

388
00:23:59,960 --> 00:24:01,000
Corrupt official!

389
00:24:04,760 --> 00:24:06,560
"Last year I passed Mount Yaowang,

390
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:08,960
and heard the people's cries of injustice.

391
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:11,480
Now the canal is cut, and many lie dead.

392
00:24:12,080 --> 00:24:14,160
The grain is stained
with the people's blood."

393
00:24:17,840 --> 00:24:21,040
"The Han kitchens overflow with meat,
their stables with fat horses.

394
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:25,040
Yet the people starve,
and bodies litter the fields!"

395
00:24:27,080 --> 00:24:28,480
The whole city is talking.

396
00:24:29,120 --> 00:24:31,880
They say your Han family
seized the people's land,

397
00:24:31,960 --> 00:24:34,080
lives in excess
while bleeding the realm and its people,

398
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,120
and deceives the throne!

399
00:24:36,560 --> 00:24:38,400
So answer me, Han Liao!

400
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:42,840
How much can one man possibly eat?

401
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:44,320
How many beds can one man sleep in?

402
00:24:44,400 --> 00:24:47,080
How did your greed become so boundless?

403
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:50,040
I deserve death!
These are malicious false accusations!

404
00:24:50,640 --> 00:24:51,640
False accusations?

405
00:24:51,720 --> 00:24:53,280
Ten essays condemning corrupt officials,

406
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:56,680
30 folk songs and 18 long poems!

407
00:24:57,280 --> 00:24:59,640
How vile must you be

408
00:25:00,240 --> 00:25:03,800
for the people
to want to flay you and devour your flesh,

409
00:25:04,400 --> 00:25:07,680
and for all those scholars
to condemn you as a corrupt villain?

410
00:25:07,760 --> 00:25:10,600
Han Liao,
the people say you deserve death!

411
00:25:13,920 --> 00:25:16,000
To appease people's anger
and quell public outrage,

412
00:25:16,520 --> 00:25:18,440
even if every charge were false,

413
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:21,840
you'd still deserve death
by a thousand cuts!

414
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:25,440
I deserve death! I am guilty!

415
00:25:26,040 --> 00:25:27,040
Your Majesty.

416
00:25:27,120 --> 00:25:31,920
I'll have the canal reopened at once
and compensate the injured people.

417
00:25:32,520 --> 00:25:35,920
I'll personally apologize
to Noble Lady Wu'an.

418
00:25:38,520 --> 00:25:39,360
Your Majesty.

419
00:25:41,080 --> 00:25:43,840
Lord Han offered his land
to escape punishment,

420
00:25:43,920 --> 00:25:46,880
then cut off the canal
and ruined the people's livelihood.

421
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,520
He is a criminal
who deceived Your Majesty.

422
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:51,240
Lord Lu!

423
00:25:52,000 --> 00:25:54,040
The tenant farmers
rejected their new master.

424
00:25:54,120 --> 00:25:55,440
They caused the trouble themselves.

425
00:25:57,600 --> 00:26:01,640
As for cutting off the canal,
I knew nothing about it.

426
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:04,920
Powerful clans have long seized land
and forced commoners into servitude.

427
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,160
It's a grave threat to the realm.

428
00:26:06,800 --> 00:26:09,440
It must be punished harshly
as a warning to others.

429
00:26:10,560 --> 00:26:12,600
Your Majesty, at Bailu Plain,

430
00:26:12,680 --> 00:26:14,200
the Empress Dowager's tomb
is under construction.

431
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:19,480
Why not move the entire Han clan
to the counties around the tomb?

432
00:26:20,240 --> 00:26:22,680
That would also stop a few refugees
from causing trouble.

433
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:24,560
Your Majesty!

434
00:26:24,640 --> 00:26:26,720
The Han clan would gladly
give our lives for the realm.

435
00:26:27,320 --> 00:26:29,280
How could we leave Your Majesty's grace?

436
00:26:29,360 --> 00:26:32,200
Building the tomb
is a matter of state. Unless…

437
00:26:33,320 --> 00:26:36,320
Lord Han
refuses to serve the Empress Dowager!

438
00:26:36,400 --> 00:26:37,280
Lu Zhuo, you…

439
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:40,320
Enough. That's settled.

440
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:44,240
The Han family has enraged the people.

441
00:26:44,320 --> 00:26:46,360
I have no choice but to punish you.

442
00:26:47,040 --> 00:26:48,760
Go outside and take 50 strokes.

443
00:26:49,680 --> 00:26:50,720
And one more thing.

444
00:26:50,800 --> 00:26:53,360
Noble Lady Wu'an
spared you from hard labor,

445
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:54,600
yet you repaid her kindness with betrayal.

446
00:26:54,680 --> 00:26:58,040
So I sentence you
to serve Wu'an as a servant for one month

447
00:26:58,800 --> 00:27:00,200
to make amends.

448
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:04,080
I…

449
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:10,000
I accept Your Majesty's decree.

450
00:27:36,080 --> 00:27:39,280
You spread rumors
to destroy everything I've built.

451
00:27:39,880 --> 00:27:43,040
Then you schemed
to have my clan exiled to Bailu Plain.

452
00:27:43,720 --> 00:27:45,840
How vile and ruthless.

453
00:27:46,920 --> 00:27:51,000
But who would ever know
that the honorable Lord Lu

454
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:55,640
is actually cold-blooded and vicious?

455
00:27:56,280 --> 00:27:57,440
Han Liao.

456
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:01,880
The night our army raided the Hutuo camp,

457
00:28:03,360 --> 00:28:05,600
who betrayed his own men for selfish gain

458
00:28:06,400 --> 00:28:09,960
and left them to die far from home,
their souls unable to rest?

459
00:28:11,120 --> 00:28:14,560
That blood debt has never left my mind.

460
00:28:15,440 --> 00:28:17,360
Sooner or later, we'll settle it.

461
00:28:18,040 --> 00:28:20,560
You have no proof. It's pure slander!

462
00:28:24,640 --> 00:28:26,720
Don't celebrate too soon.

463
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:29,360
The woman you married

464
00:28:30,360 --> 00:28:32,280
is clearly a venomous snake.

465
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:37,240
Sooner or later, you'll die by her hands.

466
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:46,640
No need to be jealous.

467
00:28:53,160 --> 00:28:55,120
You'll never have that luck to end.

468
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:16,120
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

469
00:29:25,120 --> 00:29:26,080
Get out!

470
00:29:37,040 --> 00:29:40,200
My Lord. Let me clean you up.

471
00:29:58,760 --> 00:30:01,040
You're the daughter
of the Marquis of Andu,

472
00:30:01,120 --> 00:30:04,720
yet you spend every day cowering
like you're ashamed to be seen.

473
00:30:06,680 --> 00:30:08,880
I wasted 50,000 gold coins buying you.

474
00:30:09,560 --> 00:30:11,920
You walk around looking miserable all day.

475
00:30:13,200 --> 00:30:16,120
Your whole family is useless,
with nothing but empty titles!

476
00:30:17,840 --> 00:30:19,440
What good are you to me?

477
00:30:50,560 --> 00:30:51,760
My wife went to admire
the moon in the garden

478
00:30:52,840 --> 00:30:54,400
and tragically drowned in the lake.

479
00:30:55,760 --> 00:30:57,680
Send word to the Empress Dowager.

480
00:30:59,280 --> 00:31:01,480
Tell her the Han family
must hold a funeral,

481
00:31:02,200 --> 00:31:04,120
so our clan cannot leave
the capital for now.

482
00:31:07,280 --> 00:31:09,720
As for relocating the clan
and my month of servitude,

483
00:31:11,520 --> 00:31:14,920
ask the Empress Dowager
to appeal to His Majesty for us.

484
00:31:17,600 --> 00:31:20,080
We'll need a little more time.

485
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:31,120
After all, the dead come first.

486
00:31:34,840 --> 00:31:37,760
I'm sure Noble Lady Wu'an…

487
00:31:40,760 --> 00:31:42,640
will understand.

488
00:31:44,800 --> 00:31:46,160
- It looks really good.
- Really?

489
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:49,000
- Have some water first.
- Three!

490
00:31:52,840 --> 00:31:53,880
Four!

491
00:31:54,560 --> 00:31:56,520
His Lordship sent me here
as a martial arts instructor,

492
00:31:56,600 --> 00:31:58,040
but General Qi took all the work.

493
00:31:58,640 --> 00:32:00,560
- He even said…
- Keep your stance steady!

494
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:01,640
What did he say?

495
00:32:01,720 --> 00:32:03,560
He said this is Noble Lady Wu'an's estate.

496
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:05,000
- Everyone must obey Her Ladyship.
- Five!

497
00:32:05,080 --> 00:32:06,640
Her Ladyship asked him
to find an instructor,

498
00:32:06,720 --> 00:32:07,960
so Your Lordship needn't trouble yourself.

499
00:32:08,040 --> 00:32:09,160
What kind of nonsense?

500
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:11,360
Her Ladyship is also Lord Lu's wife.
She's our lady too.

501
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:12,560
If your orders…

502
00:32:12,640 --> 00:32:13,840
- Stop.
- don't work here…

503
00:32:14,360 --> 00:32:15,720
- Six!
- He's the one overstepping,

504
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:16,640
like he's the master here.

505
00:32:17,400 --> 00:32:20,400
Those blind fools probably think
he's Her Ladyship's husband!

506
00:32:21,400 --> 00:32:22,600
Hold it!

507
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:28,640
- Up!
- My Lord.

508
00:32:31,560 --> 00:32:32,920
You idiot! Can't you take a hint?

509
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:33,840
Just running your mouth.

510
00:32:33,920 --> 00:32:35,400
And you made it worse by tattling.

511
00:32:36,000 --> 00:32:37,600
- You've really messed things up.
- Keep going!

512
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:39,280
I was only worried about His Lordship.

513
00:32:39,360 --> 00:32:40,560
- Eight!
- Losing men is one thing.

514
00:32:40,640 --> 00:32:41,880
- Losing his wife is worse.
- Enough!

515
00:32:42,600 --> 00:32:44,920
You haven't trained long enough!
Your basics are weak!

516
00:32:45,000 --> 00:32:45,960
My Lord!

517
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:47,640
I teach moves meant
for killing on the battlefield.

518
00:32:47,720 --> 00:32:49,760
Attack. Don't defend!

519
00:32:50,360 --> 00:32:51,200
Keep your back straight!

520
00:32:52,040 --> 00:32:53,080
Nine!

521
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:57,160
You have no idea.

522
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:59,880
When the Han family's lands
and servants were divided up,

523
00:32:59,960 --> 00:33:01,760
everyone in the capital
had something to say.

524
00:33:02,440 --> 00:33:04,880
Some said the Han family
were relatives of the Empress Dowager,

525
00:33:04,960 --> 00:33:07,280
and Han Liao was one of her favorites.

526
00:33:07,360 --> 00:33:09,720
They said anyone who took their land

527
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:12,480
would be asking for trouble.

528
00:33:13,000 --> 00:33:15,440
Now His Majesty had Han Liao flogged.

529
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:17,640
If the Han family
hadn't just suffered a death

530
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:19,120
and the Empress Dowager hadn't intervened,

531
00:33:19,800 --> 00:33:22,160
the whole clan would've been
sent away to build the tomb.

532
00:33:22,760 --> 00:33:26,280
Now the talk in the capital
has completely changed.

533
00:33:26,360 --> 00:33:31,000
Everyone says our Noble Lady
is blessed beyond measure.

534
00:33:31,520 --> 00:33:35,480
They all change sides
the second the wind shifts.

535
00:33:36,880 --> 00:33:40,880
I hear your new estate
has the charm of the countryside,

536
00:33:40,960 --> 00:33:42,000
like some heavenly retreat.

537
00:33:42,080 --> 00:33:46,800
All my friends keep asking me
when you'll finally host us there

538
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:49,800
and open the estate
so everyone can come enjoy it.

539
00:33:49,880 --> 00:33:51,480
Yesterday, second cousin even said

540
00:33:51,560 --> 00:33:54,480
he wants to invite some noble friends

541
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:56,480
and hunt a few wild animals.

542
00:33:56,560 --> 00:34:00,160
They say braised muntjac gives you
strength to cross three mountains.

543
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:02,960
Let's go to the estate
for barbecue and wine.

544
00:34:03,920 --> 00:34:07,160
Rao, we'll just borrow your estate.

545
00:34:07,240 --> 00:34:10,040
We'll bring everything we need ourselves.
How about it?

546
00:34:11,440 --> 00:34:12,400
No, no.

547
00:34:13,280 --> 00:34:15,760
These youngsters only care about fun,

548
00:34:15,840 --> 00:34:17,679
not knowing there's more
between noble families.

549
00:34:18,320 --> 00:34:20,600
Friends, foes, allies, spies…

550
00:34:20,679 --> 00:34:21,880
Everyone has an agenda.

551
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,440
They're waiting to see our responses.

552
00:34:23,520 --> 00:34:26,840
So, we might as well
openly invite them all

553
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:29,320
and let them
see everything for themselves.

554
00:34:29,400 --> 00:34:30,920
That makes sense.

555
00:34:33,239 --> 00:34:37,159
We're family,
so we shouldn't draw lines between us.

556
00:34:37,760 --> 00:34:40,040
But this estate is different.

557
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:43,080
Wei Rao earned it herself.

558
00:34:43,159 --> 00:34:44,800
That's not right, Sister.

559
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:47,520
Han Liao framed the Lu family.

560
00:34:47,600 --> 00:34:51,120
This estate and its lands
were compensation from the Han family.

561
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:54,679
When Han Liao used his power
to cause trouble at the ancestral temple,

562
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:57,080
I didn't see you risk your life
to stop him.

563
00:34:57,160 --> 00:35:00,960
At Xuanshi Palace,
under pressure from the Imperial Family,

564
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:03,200
I didn't see you challenge
the Empress Dowager and Prince Rong.

565
00:35:03,960 --> 00:35:06,440
When the Hans cut off the water
and hurt the farmers,

566
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:08,560
I didn't see you step up and help either.

567
00:35:09,240 --> 00:35:11,240
Now that everything's peaceful,

568
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:15,280
you either want to hunt or throw a feast.

569
00:35:15,920 --> 00:35:16,840
How can you even ask?

570
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:18,320
What do you mean by that?

571
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:21,680
Ask Noble Lady Wu'an yourself. This land…

572
00:35:22,200 --> 00:35:24,040
Was it really so easy to claim?

573
00:35:24,120 --> 00:35:26,680
The Duke's Residence
backed her all the way.

574
00:35:27,360 --> 00:35:29,480
When the Hans caused trouble
at the ancestral temple,

575
00:35:29,560 --> 00:35:31,640
which of our brothers
didn't step in to help?

576
00:35:31,720 --> 00:35:33,280
- Go on, tell me. Go on!
- Enough.

577
00:35:33,360 --> 00:35:34,720
Enough.

578
00:35:35,240 --> 00:35:36,920
We only meant well.

579
00:35:37,800 --> 00:35:39,680
The Han family is cunning and vicious.

580
00:35:40,280 --> 00:35:42,440
They're experts at dirty tricks.

581
00:35:42,520 --> 00:35:44,360
If we invite the noble families here,

582
00:35:44,440 --> 00:35:46,640
we'll make it clear
this is Lu family property.

583
00:35:47,160 --> 00:35:49,800
That'll stop anyone else from coveting it.

584
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:53,600
Privately, it'll still be your estate,
Your Ladyship.

585
00:35:53,680 --> 00:35:56,960
We already said we'd only borrow it.
Just borrowing it.

586
00:35:57,040 --> 00:35:58,240
Just borrow it.

587
00:35:58,320 --> 00:35:59,920
- Even so…
- Mother, please decide.

588
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:07,720
Rao, this is your decision to make.

589
00:36:07,800 --> 00:36:10,920
Can you handle it all on your own?

590
00:36:26,520 --> 00:36:28,600
Thank you, Aunts, for looking out for me.

591
00:36:28,680 --> 00:36:31,680
But right now,
the estate is still under renovation.

592
00:36:31,760 --> 00:36:33,400
It's not ready for guests yet.

593
00:36:33,480 --> 00:36:36,600
Everyone knows the Han family built

594
00:36:36,680 --> 00:36:38,920
a lavish estate
filled with grand pavilions.

595
00:36:39,680 --> 00:36:42,040
This estate even rivals
an imperial retreat.

596
00:36:42,640 --> 00:36:46,400
Rao, are you just reluctant to share it
and making excuses?

597
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:48,160
You child…

598
00:36:48,240 --> 00:36:49,640
Bitao.

599
00:36:51,360 --> 00:36:52,440
Old Madam, please take a look.

600
00:36:54,440 --> 00:36:56,960
The Hutuo have raided
the border repeatedly in recent years.

601
00:36:57,040 --> 00:36:58,320
War has ravaged the north.

602
00:36:58,400 --> 00:37:00,120
The people are suffering and displaced.

603
00:37:00,200 --> 00:37:01,520
When winter comes,

604
00:37:01,600 --> 00:37:03,560
even more refugees will head south.

605
00:37:03,640 --> 00:37:06,200
So I plan to build,
in front of the residences,

606
00:37:06,280 --> 00:37:08,600
threshing yards, silkworm rooms,
and workshops,

607
00:37:08,680 --> 00:37:09,520
along with livestock pens.

608
00:37:10,120 --> 00:37:13,080
We'll stockpile plenty of winter supplies
so we can shelter more refugees.

609
00:37:14,040 --> 00:37:15,560
The estate sits at the foot
of Mount Yaowang.

610
00:37:16,160 --> 00:37:18,920
This hillside
must be cleared before winter

611
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,720
and planted with
cold-and drought-resistant fruit trees.

612
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:23,360
The soil in this valley is poor,

613
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:24,880
but there's plenty of sunlight.

614
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:26,920
Next year, after improving the soil,

615
00:37:27,000 --> 00:37:28,640
we can grow medicinal herbs and flowers.

616
00:37:30,760 --> 00:37:31,680
As for these homes,

617
00:37:31,760 --> 00:37:34,280
I'll rent them cheaply
to poor scholars and commoners.

618
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:36,440
Those who can't afford rent
can work it off.

619
00:37:37,080 --> 00:37:38,320
But if we do that,

620
00:37:38,400 --> 00:37:40,600
the estate won't be fit for
entertaining noble families.

621
00:37:40,680 --> 00:37:42,560
If you want to be charitable,

622
00:37:42,640 --> 00:37:44,600
just give out more money and grain.

623
00:37:44,680 --> 00:37:48,160
But giving such a fine estate
to those common people

624
00:37:48,840 --> 00:37:50,360
would be such a waste.

625
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,680
You're the wife of a noble heir,

626
00:37:52,360 --> 00:37:54,680
yet all you talk about are fields, farms,
sheep pens, and pigsties.

627
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:56,120
People will laugh at you.

628
00:37:56,200 --> 00:37:57,040
You're far too calculating.

629
00:37:57,120 --> 00:37:59,360
Changning, watch your tongue.

630
00:37:59,960 --> 00:38:02,240
Anyone can indulge in romance,
beauty, and luxury.

631
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:06,800
But how many people today
would sacrifice themselves for others?

632
00:38:07,520 --> 00:38:09,720
I think this land… I…

633
00:38:12,080 --> 00:38:15,120
Rao, with everything planned this way,

634
00:38:15,200 --> 00:38:17,600
next year the livestock will thrive,

635
00:38:17,680 --> 00:38:18,960
and the orchards will bear abundant fruit.

636
00:38:19,040 --> 00:38:22,160
Trees, thorns, mulberry, and hemp
will turn this place into a market.

637
00:38:23,320 --> 00:38:24,680
This estate and its lands

638
00:38:24,760 --> 00:38:28,200
were nothing but a playground
for the Han family's pleasure.

639
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:30,280
But in your hands,

640
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:33,120
they can finally serve a real purpose.

641
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:37,640
Good child.

642
00:38:38,160 --> 00:38:40,640
You have vision and generosity.

643
00:38:40,720 --> 00:38:44,880
Such selflessness is truly rare.
Remarkable.

644
00:38:44,960 --> 00:38:46,600
Yes. Remarkable!

645
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:49,680
The Han family used the funeral
to delay their relocation.

646
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:53,040
I'm afraid they'll go back on their word
and come back for trouble.

647
00:38:54,480 --> 00:38:57,160
So I turned this area
into a training ground

648
00:38:57,240 --> 00:39:00,400
and picked some strong young locals
to train so they can defend themselves.

649
00:39:01,000 --> 00:39:02,320
But I know nothing
about military strategy.

650
00:39:02,400 --> 00:39:04,040
I don't know where to set up defenses

651
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:05,840
to protect the water source
and the estate.

652
00:39:07,080 --> 00:39:08,360
That's easy.

653
00:39:20,240 --> 00:39:22,600
Who knew a life of luxury
and careful upbringing

654
00:39:22,680 --> 00:39:24,400
could raise someone never work
and can't tell wheat from rice.

655
00:39:24,480 --> 00:39:25,440
Aim high, do nothing,

656
00:39:25,520 --> 00:39:27,240
and know nothing of the people's pain.

657
00:39:27,320 --> 00:39:29,240
Every great general's glory
is built on countless bones.

658
00:39:29,320 --> 00:39:31,720
Our family's honors are built on
countless soldiers' blood.

659
00:39:32,360 --> 00:39:33,760
They were all sons of poor farmers.

660
00:39:34,440 --> 00:39:36,120
You call them filthy commoners.

661
00:39:36,920 --> 00:39:38,120
Then what does that make you?

662
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:39,840
Hiding behind our family's privilege,

663
00:39:40,440 --> 00:39:41,360
you're useless, yet you think
you're better than everyone else!

664
00:39:42,840 --> 00:39:45,520
Mother, he's gone too far!

665
00:39:45,600 --> 00:39:48,280
Our brothers only wanted to go hunting
and asked me to speak for them.

666
00:39:49,040 --> 00:39:51,440
It's hardly a terrible crime.

667
00:39:51,520 --> 00:39:52,960
There's no need to go this far.

668
00:39:53,040 --> 00:39:54,720
Changning only asked
because she meant well.

669
00:39:54,800 --> 00:39:55,840
She didn't mean well.

670
00:39:56,760 --> 00:39:58,200
She's selfish and greedy.

671
00:39:58,800 --> 00:40:00,440
Aunts, when you married
into the Lu family,

672
00:40:01,440 --> 00:40:02,960
when did we ever covet
your private property?

673
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:05,000
Lu Changning.

674
00:40:05,080 --> 00:40:07,160
Those men call themselves real men,

675
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:08,880
yet they sent you to ask?

676
00:40:09,520 --> 00:40:11,280
- Tell them to speak to me!
- Look, over here.

677
00:40:11,360 --> 00:40:12,880
My army could use a few more soldiers.

678
00:40:12,960 --> 00:40:15,680
I'll find them some real work
and give them a proper workout.

679
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:17,640
Throwing your weight
around at home as the heir?

680
00:40:17,720 --> 00:40:19,240
Zhuo is right.

681
00:40:19,320 --> 00:40:20,400
That's exactly how it is.

682
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,760
- But yell at his sister like that?
- Exactly.

683
00:40:21,840 --> 00:40:24,560
Enough! Are you all finished?

684
00:40:25,120 --> 00:40:27,200
- He…
- Zhuo, come here.

685
00:40:30,320 --> 00:40:33,680
Rao wants to train people
and set up defenses.

686
00:40:33,760 --> 00:40:35,200
Isn't that your specialty?

687
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:37,520
You're an undefeated general.

688
00:40:37,600 --> 00:40:40,320
Surely you can help your wife.

689
00:40:41,640 --> 00:40:43,560
Grandmother, you don't know her.

690
00:40:43,640 --> 00:40:45,720
She handles everything herself
and hates troubling me.

691
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:48,040
She has to actually let me help first.

692
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:50,800
I've lived a long life,

693
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:55,120
and I've never heard of a landowner
giving his own homes to tenant farmers.

694
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:59,000
Rao's estate is truly unlike any other.

695
00:40:59,840 --> 00:41:00,720
Come.

696
00:41:00,800 --> 00:41:02,080
You two are husband and wife.

697
00:41:02,160 --> 00:41:05,880
You must stand together
and work toward the same goal.

698
00:41:05,960 --> 00:41:07,360
I want to see it with my own eyes

699
00:41:07,440 --> 00:41:11,760
as you two build this one-of-a-kind estate
from the ground up.

700
00:41:18,640 --> 00:41:19,880
Careful. Don't drop it.

701
00:41:27,960 --> 00:41:30,120
Your Ladyship, we're almost done packing.

702
00:41:30,640 --> 00:41:32,480
- Load these onto the carriage first.
- Yes.

703
00:41:33,120 --> 00:41:34,320
Take everything out.

704
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:35,480
Yes.

705
00:41:41,080 --> 00:41:41,920
Rao, what's all this?

706
00:41:42,600 --> 00:41:43,920
Traveling between here
and the estate every day

707
00:41:44,000 --> 00:41:44,840
isn't convenient.

708
00:41:45,480 --> 00:41:46,680
I've already spoken to Grandmother.

709
00:41:47,360 --> 00:41:48,680
I'll stay at the estate for a while.

710
00:41:49,360 --> 00:41:50,400
You're moving out?

711
00:41:51,720 --> 00:41:52,840
And you didn't even tell me?

712
00:41:53,440 --> 00:41:55,120
I meant to discuss it with you,

713
00:41:55,200 --> 00:41:56,640
but you went to the palace
early this morning.

714
00:41:57,520 --> 00:41:59,000
So I had to inform Grandmother first.

715
00:41:59,880 --> 00:42:02,880
I'll make sure they're careful
with everything and don't damage anything.

716
00:42:03,560 --> 00:42:04,440
I'll explain everything when I get back.

717
00:42:25,560 --> 00:42:26,680
My Lord.

718
00:42:28,240 --> 00:42:29,560
Ever since we left Xianzhuang,

719
00:42:30,520 --> 00:42:33,680
you've addressed me as "My Lord"
and kept me at a distance.

720
00:42:34,920 --> 00:42:36,280
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

721
00:42:37,520 --> 00:42:39,120
You already know the truth.

722
00:42:39,640 --> 00:42:41,400
- I was never…
- You are.

723
00:42:50,680 --> 00:42:53,720
Unless Noble Lady Wu'an thinks
you no longer need me as your husband,

724
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:55,560
or need my protection,

725
00:42:56,280 --> 00:42:57,720
you're free to cast aside
your title of my wife

726
00:42:57,800 --> 00:42:58,680
as if it meant nothing to you.

727
00:42:59,920 --> 00:43:03,680
Open that door and walk away
without any concern.

728
00:43:06,760 --> 00:43:08,880
- I…
- Wei Rao.

729
00:43:09,920 --> 00:43:12,280
I never know
when you're playing hard to get

730
00:43:12,360 --> 00:43:13,880
or when you're actually being sincere.

731
00:43:13,960 --> 00:43:16,720
You're unpredictable,
and you read people too well.

732
00:43:18,000 --> 00:43:20,200
You like seeing me jealous over you

733
00:43:21,440 --> 00:43:22,880
because it helps keep you safe.

734
00:43:24,160 --> 00:43:25,440
You're overthinking it, My Lord.

735
00:43:27,160 --> 00:43:28,280
I wouldn't dare.

736
00:43:28,360 --> 00:43:30,240
Don't try to fool me.

737
00:43:30,840 --> 00:43:32,720
I saw through your games long ago.

738
00:43:35,000 --> 00:43:36,400
Please forgive me, My Lord.

739
00:43:38,920 --> 00:43:40,840
I've struggled all my life to survive.

740
00:43:41,760 --> 00:43:42,760
I've only

741
00:43:44,280 --> 00:43:45,720
wanted to stay alive.

742
00:43:59,480 --> 00:44:02,520
One who commands soldiers
is called a general.

743
00:44:03,360 --> 00:44:05,640
One who commands generals
is called a commander.

744
00:44:06,240 --> 00:44:07,280
A game of chess is like a battlefield.

745
00:44:07,880 --> 00:44:10,560
The commander
is what decides victory from afar.

746
00:44:13,000 --> 00:44:14,240
You should know that.

747
00:44:15,240 --> 00:44:17,000
At a critical moment like this,

748
00:44:18,320 --> 00:44:19,480
who…

749
00:44:21,720 --> 00:44:23,440
is truly useful to you?

750
00:44:38,200 --> 00:44:40,320
The heir to the Duke of Ying, of course.

751
00:44:42,440 --> 00:44:44,560
Wei Rao's rightful husband.

752
00:44:46,240 --> 00:44:47,480
Then say it to me yourself.

753
00:44:49,080 --> 00:44:50,320
Say what?

754
00:44:50,400 --> 00:44:52,080
Say you need my protection.

755
00:44:52,600 --> 00:44:54,080
That you want to be my wife.

756
00:44:55,560 --> 00:44:59,000
You still need me
just as desperately as before.

757
00:45:00,480 --> 00:45:01,600
Of course I need you.

758
00:45:05,440 --> 00:45:08,000
Without you, I'll die.

759
00:45:36,400 --> 00:45:38,160
What should you call me?

760
00:45:44,120 --> 00:45:45,000
My dear.

761
00:46:01,360 --> 00:46:03,120
I'll move there with you.

762
00:46:15,880 --> 00:46:19,320
LV LUN, GOVERNESS CHANG'S HUSBAND

763
00:46:24,280 --> 00:46:25,240
My Lady.

764
00:46:30,920 --> 00:46:36,360
As for how Chang deceived me before,
I won't hold it against her anymore.

765
00:46:37,280 --> 00:46:38,360
From now on,

766
00:46:39,800 --> 00:46:41,360
you know what to do, don't you?

767
00:46:42,040 --> 00:46:44,800
Please have mercy, My Lady. Spare my life.

768
00:46:44,880 --> 00:46:46,600
From now on, whatever you command,

769
00:46:47,760 --> 00:46:49,680
I will obey.

770
00:47:04,480 --> 00:47:05,880
You may go.

771
00:47:08,920 --> 00:47:12,200
The Wei family sent men
to collect Governess Chang's coffin.

772
00:47:13,040 --> 00:47:15,320
I had some important instructions to give,

773
00:47:16,000 --> 00:47:17,840
so I came myself.

774
00:47:18,480 --> 00:47:20,040
While you were gone,

775
00:47:20,600 --> 00:47:23,360
Grandmother sat
in your courtyard every day,

776
00:47:23,440 --> 00:47:25,160
all day long.

777
00:47:25,680 --> 00:47:27,440
You should understand her position.

778
00:47:27,960 --> 00:47:30,240
She's not just your grandmother.

779
00:47:30,320 --> 00:47:32,520
She's also the head of the Wei family.

780
00:47:33,440 --> 00:47:37,240
If she truly loves me,
why would she side with outsiders?

781
00:47:38,080 --> 00:47:39,360
Aunt Yufeng,

782
00:47:39,440 --> 00:47:41,480
I don't care for empty words.

783
00:47:42,080 --> 00:47:45,280
I only want to know
what secret Governess Chang

784
00:47:45,960 --> 00:47:47,920
planned to tell my maternal grandmother.

785
00:47:50,560 --> 00:47:51,440
Well…

786
00:47:53,200 --> 00:47:55,080
What exactly did she say?

787
00:47:56,680 --> 00:47:58,040
She only said

788
00:47:59,320 --> 00:48:03,120
Aunt bribed the wet nurse
to abandon me on purpose.

789
00:48:04,600 --> 00:48:06,040
But I think she was lying.

790
00:48:06,640 --> 00:48:08,040
She must have been hiding something.

791
00:48:13,200 --> 00:48:14,400
Aunt Yufeng,

792
00:48:15,000 --> 00:48:18,720
please tell me exactly
what happened, word for word.

793
00:48:19,320 --> 00:48:20,720
What could there possibly be?

794
00:48:20,800 --> 00:48:24,960
She was just a greedy old woman
who stole money.

795
00:48:25,480 --> 00:48:27,280
How can you believe a word she said?

796
00:48:27,960 --> 00:48:29,640
Your aunt's heart toward you

797
00:48:29,720 --> 00:48:31,480
is a hundredfold truer than any pearl.

798
00:48:32,360 --> 00:48:35,040
You can doubt anyone, but never her.

799
00:48:35,720 --> 00:48:38,960
If she found out, she'd be heartbroken.

800
00:48:39,720 --> 00:48:42,760
Aunt Yufeng, don't dodge the question.

801
00:48:43,480 --> 00:48:46,760
Governess Chang
served the Wei family for years.

802
00:48:47,320 --> 00:48:49,840
She knew when to switch sides
and how to flatter those in power.

803
00:48:50,680 --> 00:48:54,920
Why would she flee for her life
over something as trivial as money?

804
00:48:55,880 --> 00:49:00,080
All she said was
that the wet nurse abandoned Rao.

805
00:49:00,640 --> 00:49:03,000
She never said what happened after that.

806
00:49:04,160 --> 00:49:06,200
A child vanished for an entire year.

807
00:49:06,720 --> 00:49:08,160
What could she have gone through?

808
00:49:08,720 --> 00:49:11,520
Why were the wet nurse and guards
ambushed and killed?

809
00:49:12,200 --> 00:49:13,960
Were they killed to silence them?

810
00:49:16,560 --> 00:49:18,520
- Unless the child they brought back was…
- Enough!

811
00:49:28,160 --> 00:49:32,040
Child, let me give you some advice.

812
00:49:33,600 --> 00:49:36,360
Stop digging into the distant past.

813
00:49:37,000 --> 00:49:39,880
Let the past stay buried.

814
00:49:40,800 --> 00:49:41,920
Digging any deeper…

815
00:49:43,960 --> 00:49:45,000
will do you

816
00:49:46,160 --> 00:49:48,240
no good at all.

817
00:49:48,840 --> 00:49:50,160
Do you understand?

818
00:49:56,760 --> 00:49:57,760
Good girl.

819
00:49:59,080 --> 00:50:02,000
Forget about Governess Chang.

820
00:50:02,720 --> 00:50:04,520
Pretend you never met her.

821
00:50:04,600 --> 00:50:06,520
Those questions in your heart,

822
00:50:07,760 --> 00:50:10,160
bury them deep inside.

823
00:50:11,280 --> 00:50:12,480
Forever.

824
00:50:13,320 --> 00:50:15,240
Never, ever ask them out loud.

825
00:50:18,000 --> 00:50:22,920
If anything troubles you,
go to your aunt for advice.

826
00:50:23,920 --> 00:50:27,120
Everyone in this world may hurt you.

827
00:50:29,080 --> 00:50:30,400
But she alone…

828
00:50:32,480 --> 00:50:34,720
will protect you.

829
00:53:01,840 --> 00:53:03,800
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
